date-released: "2026-10-31"
keywords:
  - hydrogen storage
  - underground hydrogen storage
  - reservoir simulation
  - Peng-Robinson
  - finite volume
abstract: >
  H2MultiSim is a dependency-free Python toolkit for underground hydrogen storage
  modelling across 0D, 1D, 2D and 3D scales, with a shared Peng-Robinson
  thermodynamic core and Monte Carlo uncertainty quantification.
